# KI-009: Neutralisation quenches an acid-driven sulfur clock
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
wait 10s
inspect v1
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
wait 30s
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
wait 30s
inspect v1
inspect
